{"seq":4,"slug":"versioning-and-migration","title":"版本管理与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/versioning-and-migration","wordCount":909,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本管理与迁移\">版本管理与迁移</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>版本管理与迁移</strong>回答两个问题：如何用版本号向用户传达&quot;这次升级会不会破坏我的用法&quot;，以及当确实破坏时如何帮用户平滑过渡。前者靠 <strong>SemVer</strong>，后者靠 <strong>Deprecation 策略与迁移指南</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本部分</th>\n<th>变更时机</th>\n<th>兼容性影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MAJOR</td>\n<td>不兼容的 API 变更</td>\n<td>用户可能需要改用法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MINOR</td>\n<td>向后兼容的新功能</td>\n<td>用户无需修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PATCH</td>\n<td>向后兼容的问题修复</td>\n<td>用户无需修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心原则：<strong>破坏性变更必须被预告</strong>——先弃用（发出警告）再移除，并随版本提供迁移指南，而不是在新版本中直接失效。本文从语义化版本讲到 Breaking Changes、弃用与自动迁移。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"语义化版本号\">语义化版本号</h2><p><strong>语义化版本号</strong>（Semantic Versioning，简称 SemVer）是软件版本管理的行业标准。版本号格式为 <code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>，每个数字的变更传达明确的兼容性信息。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本部分</th>\n<th>变更时机</th>\n<th>兼容性影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MAJOR</td>\n<td>不兼容的 API 变更</td>\n<td>用户可能需要修改用法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MINOR</td>\n<td>向后兼容的新功能</td>\n<td>用户无需修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PATCH</td>\n<td>向后兼容的问题修复</td>\n<td>用户无需修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[1.2.3] --&gt; B{变更类型}&#10;    B --&gt;|破坏性变更| C[2.0.0]&#10;    B --&gt;|新增功能| D[1.3.0]&#10;    B --&gt;|修复问题| E[1.2.4]\">graph LR\n    A[1.2.3] --&gt; B{变更类型}\n    B --&gt;|破坏性变更| C[2.0.0]\n    B --&gt;|新增功能| D[1.3.0]\n    B --&gt;|修复问题| E[1.2.4]</pre><p>在 Cargo.toml 中管理版本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[package]&#10;name = &quot;mytool&quot;&#10;version = &quot;1.2.3&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[package]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name = \"mytool\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>version = \"1.2.3\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use clap::Parser;&#10;&#10;#[derive(Parser)]&#10;#[command(version = env!(&quot;CARGO_PKG_VERSION&quot;))]&#10;struct Cli {&#10;    #[command(subcommand)]&#10;    command: Commands,&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[derive(clap::Subcommand)]&#10;enum Commands {&#10;    Version,&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let cli = Cli::parse();&#10;    match cli.command {&#10;        Commands::Version =&gt; {&#10;            println!(&quot;mytool {}&quot;, env!(&quot;CARGO_PKG_VERSION&quot;));&#10;            println!(&quot;commit: {}&quot;, option_env!(&quot;GIT_HASH&quot;).unwrap_or(&quot;unknown&quot;));&#10;            println!(&quot;target: {}&quot;, env!(&quot;TARGET&quot;));&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use clap::Parser;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Parser)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[command(version = env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\"))]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Cli {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    #[command(subcommand)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    command: Commands,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(clap::Subcommand)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum Commands {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Version,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let cli = Cli::parse();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match cli.command {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Commands::Version => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"mytool {}\", env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"commit: {}\", option_env!(\"GIT_HASH\").unwrap_or(\"unknown\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"target: {}\", env!(\"TARGET\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"breaking-changes\">Breaking Changes</h2><p><strong>破坏性变更</strong>（Breaking Changes）是 CLI 工具中最敏感的版本决策。以下行为被视为破坏性变更：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>移除命令</td>\n<td>删除 <code>deploy</code> 子命令</td>\n<td>依赖该命令的脚本失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改变参数</td>\n<td><code>--output</code> 改为 <code>--out</code></td>\n<td>现有命令行调用失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改变默认值</td>\n<td>默认端口从 3000 改为 8080</td>\n<td>行为预期不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改变输出格式</td>\n<td>JSON 字段重命名</td>\n<td>下游解析失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改变退出码</td>\n<td>错误退出码从 1 改为 2</td>\n<td>脚本分支逻辑错误</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn check_compatibility() {&#10;    let breaking_changes = vec![&#10;        &quot;移除或重命名子命令&quot;,&#10;        &quot;移除或重命名命令行选项&quot;,&#10;        &quot;改变现有选项的默认值&quot;,&#10;        &quot;改变 stdout/stderr 的输出格式&quot;,&#10;        &quot;改变退出码的含义&quot;,&#10;        &quot;改变配置文件格式&quot;,&#10;        &quot;提高最低运行时版本要求&quot;,&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    let safe_changes = vec![&#10;        &quot;新增子命令&quot;,&#10;        &quot;新增选项（有默认值）&quot;,&#10;        &quot;新增输出格式选项&quot;,&#10;        &quot;改进错误消息文本&quot;,&#10;        &quot;优化性能&quot;,&#10;        &quot;新增环境变量支持&quot;,&#10;    ];&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;=== 破坏性变更 ===&quot;);&#10;    for change in &amp;breaking_changes {&#10;        println!(&quot;  ✗ {}&quot;, change);&#10;    }&#10;    println!(&quot;\\n=== 安全变更 ===&quot;);&#10;    for change in &amp;safe_changes {&#10;        println!(&quot;  ✓ {}&quot;, change);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    check_compatibility();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn check_compatibility() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let breaking_changes = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"移除或重命名子命令\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"移除或重命名命令行选项\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"改变现有选项的默认值\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"改变 stdout/stderr 的输出格式\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"改变退出码的含义\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"改变配置文件格式\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"提高最低运行时版本要求\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let safe_changes = vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"新增子命令\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"新增选项（有默认值）\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"新增输出格式选项\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"改进错误消息文本\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"优化性能\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"新增环境变量支持\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"=== 破坏性变更 ===\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for change in &#x26;breaking_changes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"  ✗ {}\", change);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"\\n=== 安全变更 ===\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for change in &#x26;safe_changes {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"  ✓ {}\", change);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    check_compatibility();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 当不确定变更是否破坏性时，保守处理——将其视为破坏性变更并提升 MAJOR 版本号。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"deprecation-策略\">Deprecation 策略</h2><p><strong>弃用策略</strong>（Deprecation Strategy）为用户提供平滑过渡的时间窗口。弃用的功能应在至少一个 MINOR 版本中保留并发出警告，然后在下一个 MAJOR 版本中移除。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::io::IsTerminal;&#10;&#10;fn deprecated_warning(old: &amp;str, new: &amp;str, remove_version: &amp;str) {&#10;    if std::io::stderr().is_terminal() {&#10;        eprintln!(&#10;            &quot;\\x1b[33m⚠ 弃用警告: &#39;{}&#39; 将在 v{} 中移除，请使用 &#39;{}&#39; 代替\\x1b[0m&quot;,&#10;            old, remove_version, new&#10;        );&#10;    } else {&#10;        eprintln!(&#10;            &quot;⚠ 弃用警告: &#39;{}&#39; 将在 v{} 中移除，请使用 &#39;{}&#39; 代替&quot;,&#10;            old, remove_version, new&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn handle_legacy_arg(arg: &amp;str) -&gt; &amp;str {&#10;    match arg {&#10;        &quot;--output-dir&quot; =&gt; {&#10;            deprecated_warning(&quot;--output-dir&quot;, &quot;--out-dir&quot;, &quot;3.0&quot;);&#10;            &quot;--out-dir&quot;&#10;        }&#10;        &quot;--no-color&quot; =&gt; {&#10;            deprecated_warning(&quot;--no-color&quot;, &quot;NO_COLOR 环境变量&quot;, &quot;3.0&quot;);&#10;            &quot;--no-color&quot;&#10;        }&#10;        other =&gt; other,&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let args: Vec&lt;String&gt; = std::env::args().collect();&#10;    for arg in &amp;args[1..] {&#10;        let resolved = handle_legacy_arg(arg);&#10;        println!(&quot;使用参数: {}&quot;, resolved);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::io::IsTerminal;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn deprecated_warning(old: &#x26;str, new: &#x26;str, remove_version: &#x26;str) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if std::io::stderr().is_terminal() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"\\x1b[33m⚠ 弃用警告: '{}' 将在 v{} 中移除，请使用 '{}' 代替\\x1b[0m\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            old, remove_version, new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        eprintln!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"⚠ 弃用警告: '{}' 将在 v{} 中移除，请使用 '{}' 代替\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            old, remove_version, new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn handle_legacy_arg(arg: &#x26;str) -> &#x26;str {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    match arg {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"--output-dir\" => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deprecated_warning(\"--output-dir\", \"--out-dir\", \"3.0\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"--out-dir\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"--no-color\" => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deprecated_warning(\"--no-color\", \"NO_COLOR 环境变量\", \"3.0\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"--no-color\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        other => other,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let args: Vec&#x3C;String> = std::env::args().collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for arg in &#x26;args[1..] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let resolved = handle_legacy_arg(arg);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"使用参数: {}\", resolved);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[v1.x 功能正常] --&gt; B[v2.0 添加弃用警告]&#10;    B --&gt; C[v2.x 持续警告]&#10;    C --&gt; D[v3.0 移除旧功能]\">graph LR\n    A[v1.x 功能正常] --&gt; B[v2.0 添加弃用警告]\n    B --&gt; C[v2.x 持续警告]\n    C --&gt; D[v3.0 移除旧功能]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>弃用阶段</th>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引入替代</td>\n<td>v2.0</td>\n<td>新旧功能并存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃用警告</td>\n<td>v2.0+</td>\n<td>旧功能输出警告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文档标注</td>\n<td>v2.0+</td>\n<td>文档标记为已弃用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正式移除</td>\n<td>v3.0</td>\n<td>旧功能不再可用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"迁移指南\">迁移指南</h2><p>每个 MAJOR 版本升级都应提供详细的<strong>迁移指南</strong>（Migration Guide），帮助用户平滑过渡。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn print_migration_guide() {&#10;    let guide = r#&quot;&#10;# v2 → v3 迁移指南&#10;&#10;## 破坏性变更&#10;&#10;### 1. 配置文件格式变更&#10;- v2: `config.json`&#10;- v3: `config.toml`&#10;- 迁移: 运行 `mytool migrate-config`&#10;&#10;### 2. 参数重命名&#10;- `--output-dir` → `--out-dir`&#10;- `--no-color` → 使用 `NO_COLOR=1` 环境变量&#10;&#10;### 3. 子命令变更&#10;- `mytool deploy --env prod` → `mytool deploy prod`&#10;- `mytool config show` → `mytool config list`&#10;&#10;## 自动迁移&#10;&#10;运行以下命令自动执行大部分迁移:&#10;  mytool migrate --from v2&#10;&#10;## 需要帮助?&#10;&#10;提交 issue: https://github.com/myorg/mytool/issues&#10;&quot;#;&#10;    println!(&quot;{}&quot;, guide);&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    print_migration_guide();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_migration_guide() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let guide = r#\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># v2 → v3 迁移指南</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 破坏性变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>### 1. 配置文件格式变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- v2: `config.json`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- v3: `config.toml`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- 迁移: 运行 `mytool migrate-config`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>### 2. 参数重命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- `--output-dir` → `--out-dir`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- `--no-color` → 使用 `NO_COLOR=1` 环境变量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>### 3. 子命令变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- `mytool deploy --env prod` → `mytool deploy prod`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>- `mytool config show` → `mytool config list`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 自动迁移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>运行以下命令自动执行大部分迁移:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mytool migrate --from v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>## 需要帮助?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>提交 issue: https://github.com/myorg/mytool/issues</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"#;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"{}\", guide);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print_migration_guide();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>迁移辅助</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动迁移命令</td>\n<td><code>mytool migrate</code></td>\n<td>自动转换配置格式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容模式</td>\n<td><code>--compat v2</code></td>\n<td>临时使用旧行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃用警告</td>\n<td>运行时提示</td>\n<td>发现需要修改的用法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迁移指南文档</td>\n<td>MIGRATION.md</td>\n<td>详细的升级步骤</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"版本信息嵌入\">版本信息嵌入</h2><p>在编译时嵌入版本信息，帮助用户和维护者定位具体的构建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn main() {&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rustc-env=GIT_HASH={}&quot;, git_hash());&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rustc-env=BUILD_DATE={}&quot;, build_date());&#10;    println!(&quot;cargo:rustc-env=TARGET={}&quot;, std::env::var(&quot;TARGET&quot;).unwrap_or_default());&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn git_hash() -&gt; String {&#10;    std::process::Command::new(&quot;git&quot;)&#10;        .args([&quot;rev-parse&quot;, &quot;--short&quot;, &quot;HEAD&quot;])&#10;        .output()&#10;        .ok()&#10;        .and_then(|o| String::from_utf8(o.stdout).ok())&#10;        .map(|s| s.trim().to_string())&#10;        .unwrap_or_else(|| &quot;unknown&quot;.to_string())&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn build_date() -&gt; String {&#10;    chrono::Utc::now().format(&quot;%Y-%m-%d&quot;).to_string()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rustc-env=GIT_HASH={}\", git_hash());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rustc-env=BUILD_DATE={}\", build_date());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"cargo:rustc-env=TARGET={}\", std::env::var(\"TARGET\").unwrap_or_default());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn git_hash() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    std::process::Command::new(\"git\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .args([\"rev-parse\", \"--short\", \"HEAD\"])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .output()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .ok()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .and_then(|o| String::from_utf8(o.stdout).ok())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|s| s.trim().to_string())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .unwrap_or_else(|| \"unknown\".to_string())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn build_date() -> String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    chrono::Utc::now().format(\"%Y-%m-%d\").to_string()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"fn print_version_info() {&#10;    println!(&quot;mytool {}&quot;, env!(&quot;CARGO_PKG_VERSION&quot;));&#10;    println!(&quot;  commit:  {}&quot;, env!(&quot;GIT_HASH&quot;));&#10;    println!(&quot;  built:   {}&quot;, env!(&quot;BUILD_DATE&quot;));&#10;    println!(&quot;  target:  {}&quot;, env!(&quot;TARGET&quot;));&#10;    println!(&quot;  rustc:   {}&quot;, env!(&quot;RUSTC_VERSION&quot;));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fn print_version_info() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"mytool {}\", env!(\"CARGO_PKG_VERSION\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"  commit:  {}\", env!(\"GIT_HASH\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"  built:   {}\", env!(\"BUILD_DATE\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"  target:  {}\", env!(\"TARGET\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"  rustc:   {}\", env!(\"RUSTC_VERSION\"));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 <code>--version</code> 输出中包含 Git commit hash 和构建日期，能帮助用户在报告问题时提供准确的版本信息。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((版本管理与迁移))&#10;    SemVer&#10;      MAJOR 破坏性&#10;      MINOR 新功能&#10;      PATCH 修复&#10;    Breaking Changes&#10;      命令/参数变更&#10;      输出格式变更&#10;      默认值变更&#10;    Deprecation&#10;      警告阶段&#10;      过渡期&#10;      正式移除&#10;    迁移支持&#10;      自动迁移命令&#10;      迁移指南文档&#10;      兼容模式\">mindmap\n  root((版本管理与迁移))\n    SemVer\n      MAJOR 破坏性\n      MINOR 新功能\n      PATCH 修复\n    Breaking Changes\n      命令/参数变更\n      输出格式变更\n      默认值变更\n    Deprecation\n      警告阶段\n      过渡期\n      正式移除\n    迁移支持\n      自动迁移命令\n      迁移指南文档\n      兼容模式</pre><ul>\n<li>语义化版本号通过 MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH 传达变更的兼容性影响</li>\n<li>破坏性变更包括移除命令、修改参数名、改变输出格式和默认值等</li>\n<li>弃用策略提供过渡期：先警告至少一个 MINOR 版本，再在下一个 MAJOR 版本移除</li>\n<li>每个 MAJOR 版本升级应提供迁移指南和自动迁移工具</li>\n<li>版本信息中嵌入 Git hash 和构建日期，帮助精确定位和问题排查</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本管理与迁移","id":"版本管理与迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语义化版本号","id":"语义化版本号"},{"level":2,"text":"Breaking Changes","id":"breaking-changes"},{"level":2,"text":"Deprecation 策略","id":"deprecation-策略"},{"level":2,"text":"迁移指南","id":"迁移指南"},{"level":2,"text":"版本信息嵌入","id":"版本信息嵌入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"包管理器分发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/cli-tool-development/testing-and-publishing/homebrew-and-package-managers"},"next":null}